{"key":"home","path":"/","content":{"sections":[{"id":"8b9e00d593ec4da9af5f1f5a301a725b","type":"hero","hidden":false,"data":{"buttons":[{"href":"/our-work","label":"Explore Our Work"},{"href":"/field-notes","label":"Read Field Notes"}],"eyebrow":"Urban Suburban Perspectives","heading":"What We Inherit. What We Create. What We Carry Forward.","image":{"caption":"","media_id":"6fc82b55f714459f9499182413231bbb","media":{"id":"6fc82b55f714459f9499182413231bbb","kind":"image","width":1600,"height":1194,"srcs":[{"w":800,"url":"/api/media/6fc82b55f714459f9499182413231bbb/800?v=1"},{"w":1600,"url":"/api/media/6fc82b55f714459f9499182413231bbb/1600?v=1"}],"src":"/api/media/6fc82b55f714459f9499182413231bbb/1600?v=1","alt":"Eight women seated beneath a roof with basket-making materials around them.","caption":"Women working with basket-making materials beneath a shaded roof.","credit":"","focal_desktop":{"x":50,"y":50},"focal_mobile":{"x":50,"y":50},"filename":"Original4-edited.webp","public_ok":true,"original":{"id":"e8937a0a945b4aa8ada189813238f54d","src":"/api/media/e8937a0a945b4aa8ada189813238f54d/1280?v=1","srcs":[{"w":800,"url":"/api/media/e8937a0a945b4aa8ada189813238f54d/800?v=1"},{"w":1280,"url":"/api/media/e8937a0a945b4aa8ada189813238f54d/1280?v=1"}],"width":1280,"height":960,"alt":"Eight women seated beneath a roof with basket-making materials around them."},"edit_note":"Client-supplied edited version: peripheral clean-up and exposure balance; all eight women, roof and both pillars retained."}},"intro":"Culture isn’t fixed in time. It is inherited and reinterpreted, questioned and created, lived and shared.\n\nUrban Suburban Perspectives works across Heritage, Art and Culture, exploring how what we inherit continues to find meaning in contemporary life."},"styles":{"_section":{"height":"516px"},"heading":{"color":"#000000","fontSize":"32px","height":"154px","translateY":"116px","width":"1165px","translateX":"32.765625px","lineHeight":"1.3"},"tagline":{"color":"#000000","fontFamily":"Public Sans","fontWeight":"300","height":"33px","translateY":"87px","width":"1164px","translateX":"33px","fontSize":"22px"}}},{"id":"9acbb2583dfc483ab0f1a5654ac1786f","type":"text","hidden":false,"data":{"body_html":"<p>A place, a building, a story, a tradition or a way of making can hold meaning far beyond where it began. USP brings together people, knowledge and different perspectives to explore how these inheritances can remain meaningful in the present—and become a starting point for new ideas, creative expression and opportunity.</p><p>Across Heritage, Art and Culture, the work takes different forms, each shaped by its own context and the people involved. Through it, people can develop skills, share knowledge, shape what is created and open new pathways to livelihood.</p>","eyebrow":"Who We Are","heading":"Heritage, Art and Culture -Kept in Motion.","style":"columns"},"styles":{"body_html":{"color":"#242424","fontSize":"18px","fontWeight":"300","paddingRight":"0px","translateX":"-32px","width":"691px","height":"278px","translateY":"-13px"},"eyebrow":{"color":"#000000","translateX":"98px","width":"397px","height":"24px","translateY":"-10px"},"heading":{"color":"#000000","fontSize":"28px","translateX":"98px","width":"382px","translateY":"-18px","height":"145px"},"_section":{"height":"473px"}}},{"id":"0fce152d3e824b669ab612fe37c98dd3","type":"related_work","hidden":false,"data":{"eyebrow":"Our Work","heading":"Shaped by Place, Knowledge and Perspectives.","intro":"Each initiative begins differently—with a place, an idea, a practice or a question worth exploring. Its direction develops from the context and from the knowledge and perspectives that become part of the work.","items":[{"href":"/our-work/rakhigarhi","image":{"caption":"","media_id":"2a82250608b54857afe26c78d35bd669","media":{"id":"2a82250608b54857afe26c78d35bd669","kind":"image","width":960,"height":1280,"srcs":[{"w":800,"url":"/api/media/2a82250608b54857afe26c78d35bd669/800?v=1"},{"w":